{"seq":7,"slug":"smart-elderly-care","title":"职业本科智慧健康养老","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care","introMarkdown":"# 职业本科智慧健康养老\n\n让我先说说为什么我会一头扎进这个领域。几年前我陪着外婆去办失能评估，看着护理员用一张表格、一支笔记录她\"能不能自己穿衣、能不能独立如厕\"，再看护理站墙上那块亮着红绿灯的呼叫屏，我突然意识到：养老早已不只是\"找个人来搭把手\"那么简单，它正在变成一门需要医学、护理、信息技术和运营管理交织在一起的专业。智慧健康养老，正是这门专业的名字。\n\n到 2024 年底，中国 60 岁及以上人口已经达到约 3.1 亿，正式进入中度老龄化社会。这个数字背后，是无数个像我外婆这样的家庭在思考：钱够不够？谁来照护？住在家里还是去机构？身体出状况了第一时间有没有人知道？这些看似琐碎的问题，恰恰构成了一个庞大产业的真实需求。\n\n这套学习材料，是我从一个完全的外行起步，一边查政策、一边看设备、一边跟一线护理员聊天攒下来的笔记。我把它整理成四个互相衔接的部分。\n\n第一部分讲老龄化与养老服务体系。我会先把\"居家为基础、社区为依托、机构为专业支撑、医养结合\"这套国家框架讲清楚，再带你看长期护理保险这类正在 2026 年从试点走向全国的制度，理解整个行业是怎么被政策托起来的。\n\n第二部分讲健康管理与照护。这是最贴近老人身体的部分：慢性病怎么长期盯住、失能老人的日常照护和康复怎么做、认知症（阿尔茨海默病这类）老人又需要怎样不同的陪伴。\n\n第三部分讲智慧养老技术与设备。物联网、可穿戴设备、毫米波雷达跌倒检测、数据平台和 AI 服务——技术不是炫技，而是把\"有没有人知道老人摔倒了\"这件事变成可靠的系统。\n\n第四部分讲机构运营与服务。再好的理念也要落到一家能持续运转的机构里，所以我会讲成本、人力、等级评定和服务质量标准。\n\n我尽量用大白话讲，遇到公式或评估量表也会拆开慢慢说。如果你和当年的我一样，是带着一个具体的人、一个具体的牵挂走进这个领域的，那这份材料应该能陪你走一段。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aging-and-service-system","title":"老龄化与养老服务体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/aging-and-service-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aging-society-and-needs","title":"老龄化社会与养老需求","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/aging-and-service-system/aging-society-and-needs"},{"seq":2,"slug":"elderly-care-service-system","title":"养老服务体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/aging-and-service-system/elderly-care-service-system"},{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-and-industry-landscape","title":"政策与产业格局","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/aging-and-service-system/policy-and-industry-landscape"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"health-management-and-care","title":"健康管理与照护","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/health-management-and-care","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chronic-disease-and-health-monitoring","title":"慢性病与健康监测","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/health-management-and-care/chronic-disease-and-health-monitoring"},{"seq":2,"slug":"daily-care-and-rehabilitation","title":"日常照护与康复","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/health-management-and-care/daily-care-and-rehabilitation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dementia-and-mental-health-care","title":"认知症与心理照护","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/health-management-and-care/dementia-and-mental-health-care"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-care-technology","title":"智慧养老技术与设备","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/smart-care-technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"iot-and-wearable-devices","title":"物联网与可穿戴设备","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/smart-care-technology/iot-and-wearable-devices"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-platform-and-ai-services","title":"数据平台与 AI 服务","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/smart-care-technology/data-platform-and-ai-services"},{"seq":3,"slug":"emergency-response-and-safety","title":"紧急响应与安全","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/smart-care-technology/emergency-response-and-safety"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations-and-service","title":"机构运营与服务","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/operations-and-service","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"care-institution-operations","title":"养老机构运营","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/operations-and-service/care-institution-operations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"service-quality-and-standards","title":"服务质量与标准","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/operations-and-service/service-quality-and-standards"}]}]}